\nグループにとって。個人にとって。\n新たなスタートになればいいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの力を全部出してぶつかるのみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん完成楽しみにしていてください♪"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-36478":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんさん◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/14/1981129/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/14/1981129/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんになる時間が少ないから\nすっぴんの時間は大切！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肌もノンストレスにしないとね( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私のスキンケアは\n化粧水と乳液とホホバオイルだけ！\n全部無印良品のもの使ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっぷり使うのが私流◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日発売のEX大衆に成人特集で\nみおなと一緒にインタビューを\nしていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いの印象だとか\n成人を迎えてどんな心境だとか\n色々と喋りました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和気藹々楽しかったな(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん明日の待ち時間等々...\n是非読んでください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/01/14/1981129/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人の写真を撮り忘れてしまったので\n5人の写真。\n前のとは別バージョン♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p